WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.432
There is no single best data shape.

00:00:02.432 --> 00:00:06.672
A wide matrix may be excellent for a fixed dashboard.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:11.782
A long table is often better for trend analysis, flexible filtering, and visualization.

00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:17.817
The shape should be chosen based on the next consumer of the data.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.978
Do not reshape just because wide or long looks more familiar.
